<title>HONG KONG: Esprit Asia to be renamed Esprit Holdings.</title>
<headline>Esprit Asia to be renamed Esprit Holdings.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fashion distributor and wholesaler Esprit Asia Holdings Ltd, said on Thursday it had changed its name to Esprit Holdings Ltd to reflect its global presence.</p>
<p>&quot;Esprit has spread its wings beyond the boundary of the Asia Pacific region,&quot; Esprit Holdings chairman Michael Ying said in a statement.</p>
<p>The name change to Esprit Holdings was effective from Thursday, the statement said.</p>
<p>Esprit shares closed down HK$0.20 at HK$3.575.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6321</p>
</text>
